019-11-03 19:47:40","date_utc":"2019-11-03 18:47:40","modified":"2019-11-03 19:47:40","modified_utc":"2019-11-03 18:47:40","url":"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/local\/almo2bar-4\/","venue":"Almo2bar","slug":"almo2bar-4","address":"Calle Bruniquer 59-61 (Pl. Joanic)","city":"Barcelona","zip":"08024","show_map":true,"show_map_link":true,"global_id":"grupalmodobar.com?id=397","global_id_lineage":["grupalmodobar.com?id=397"]},"organizer":[]},{"id":4637,"global_id":"grupalmodobar.com?id=4637","global_id_lineage":["grupalmodobar.com?id=4637"],"author":"3","status":"publish","date":"2026-08-07 18:55:18","date_utc":"2026-08-07 16:55:18","modified":"2026-08-07 18:55:18","modified_utc":"2026-08-07 16:55:18","url":"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/concierto\/15-aniversario-la-fonoteca-gudar-pequeno-mal\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/4637","title":"15 ANIVERSARIO &#8220;LA FONOTECA&#8221;  G\u00daDAR + PEQUE\u00d1O MAL","description":"<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>S\u00e1bado 19 septiembre 2026 \u00b7 20:30 horas<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">La Fonoteca Barcelona se despide tras 15 a\u00f1os de actividad. Para la ocasi\u00f3n organizar\u00e1 dos \u00faltimas fiestas, la primera juntando a <strong>G\u00fadar <\/strong>y <strong>Peque\u00f1o Mal<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PEQUENO-MAL.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"676\" src=\"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PEQUENO-MAL-1024x676.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4639\" srcset=\"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PEQUENO-MAL-1024x676.png 1024w, https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PEQUENO-MAL-300x198.png 300w, https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PEQUENO-MAL-768x507.png 768w, https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PEQUENO-MAL.png 1133w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 89vw, (max-width: 1000px) 54vw, (max-width: 1071px) 543px, 580px\" \/><\/a><figcaption><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">PEQUE\u00d1O MAL<\/span><\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Peque\u00f1o Mal<\/strong> nace en M\u00e1laga como el nuevo proyecto de Saray Botella y Lolo Guti\u00e9rrez (<strong>Hazte Lap\u00f3n<\/strong>), junto a Antonio y Carlos Fern\u00e1ndez Hermana (<strong>Living Camboya<\/strong>) y Fernando Bertola (<strong>S\u00faper Cad\u00e1ve<\/strong>r). Una banda de guitarras afiladas, melod\u00eda y electricidad emocional que combina new wave, power pop y noise pop con letras que no esquivan el dolor ni el deseo. Sus canciones beben tanto del indie rock de los 90 (<strong>Pixies<\/strong>, <strong>Sonic Youth<\/strong>) como de la canci\u00f3n ligera europea, creando un contraste propio entre belleza y abrasi\u00f3n. Tras mostrarnos una incre\u00edble colecci\u00f3n de singles, ultiman su primer LP, previsto para octubre, del que pronto se conocer\u00e1n nuevas canciones y que supondr\u00e1 la consolidaci\u00f3n definitiva de su identidad sonora.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Peque\u00f1o Mal - Golden Retriever (video oficial)\" width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/qWd8ZprOWxY?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GUDAR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"680\" height=\"655\" src=\"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GUDAR.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4644\" srcset=\"https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GUDAR.jpg 680w, https:\/\/grupalmodobar.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GUDAR-300x289.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px\" \/><\/a><figcaption><span class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">G\u00daDAR<\/span><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>G\u00fadar<\/strong> es una de las bandas fetiche de La Fonoteca. Los del Baix han hecho del estilo libre su raz\u00f3n de ser, combinando una personal\u00edsima manera de entender el rock que podr\u00eda recordar a unos <strong>Pavement <\/strong>a\u00fan m\u00e1s desmadejados con unas letras \u00e1cidas y una deslavazada mezcla de folk, lisergia experimental y pop lo-fi. Una apuesta \u00fanica que los ha convertido en una de las bandas clave del underground barcelon\u00e9s. Solo quieren seguir haciendo canciones y tocando con amigos.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#db0000;font-size:22px\"><strong>PRECIO ENTRADA<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Taquilla : <\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Anticipada : 13\u20ac  <\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div style=\"height:60px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link\" href=\"https:\/\/dice.fm\/event\/6dae27-lafonoteca-bcn-se-despide-gdarpequeo-mal-19th-sep-almo2bar-barcelona-tickets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Comprar entrada anticipada<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#db0000;font-size:22px\"><strong>DIA + HORA CO